      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("I sssee now you are not Shek’kahan. I sssaw as I wished to sssee."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("As have I..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("What do you mean?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("As a fledgling long ago... I strayed far from the Eyrie of Vladnir, lost in dreams of glorious things to be. From a cave nearby I heard cries. My friend Resha had happened upon a dishonored rogue hiding within. It sought her death to keep secret its presence there. It had cornered her."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I thought myself invulnerable, the hero in my own tale. I charged at the beast, striking with bare claws, spitting feeble sparks. With one swipe I was sent to the ground, bleeding."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("My body froze me as it readied to flee... The desire to flee was overwhelming... Flee... abandon Resha to die..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("The agonizing guilt of that last thought— <i>Leave my friend to die.</i> It reignited my heart with an unfamiliar passion. I would do anything to save my friend. I felt the whole world around me burning for the means to save her."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("That is when I felt it beneath my right wing. A clasher’s spear, broken a reach beneath the head. It had not been there when I entered the cave. It was there now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("The rogue turned to finish Resha. I threw myself upon it with all my hate. The spear I ran deep into its cold heart."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Ever since have I trusted absolutely in the fire that saved my friend... Ever since have I fled the fear that drove me toward such vile cowardice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("You shunned Resha’s fears too."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Breathing in her fears could chill my heart to cowardice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("Yet her heart was brave. Her fear for you made it ssso."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("...... It did."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("Your fear for her made you brave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("A discarded spear made me brave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("That ssspear was your means to sssave your friend. It appeared <b>as</b> you feared for her. Because you did."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("............"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horn-signals/horn-1.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "knalgan_theme.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "frantic.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "casualties_of_war.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Arinexis",
            unit: "Arinexis",
            x: 29,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Arinexis",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Come ssswiftly! Deep dwellers emerge!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 1,
            shroud: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horn-signals/horn-3.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thurdakor",
            text: _("Sae whit hae we ’ere? Dragons... Sae mony dragons mah een cannae hawp whit thay’re seeing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Thurdakor",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("It ssspeaksss but I hear no words... deep dwellers mussssst be drunken."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("It sssaid “dragons” and... <i>sssssomething</i> about dragons."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thurdakor",
            text: _("A’ richt, noo ye listen tae me, dragons. Ah cannae hae ye juist standing aroond th’ hail winter dumping yer ye-ken-whit oan th’ frozen slopes, whilk, come spring, wull mak’ fur a stowed oot Knalgan gusher, if ye ken whit ah mean."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horn-signals/horn-4.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I do not grasp the words you speak. Use fewer of them with less haste."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horn-signals/horn-5.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thurdakor",
            text: _("Noo juist whit in th’ fiendish skies ‘boon is that suppose tae mean?! Ah wull hae ye ken—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Your hornblower ssspews notesss over your words!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thurdakor",
            text: _("Juist dingy him, he hud awfy much tae dram."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("If you depart now no harm will come to you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thurdakor",
            text: _("Weel that is it then, wee jimmies. Ye a’ saw how ah tried tae be reasonable. Bit thare is na reasoning wi’ dragons. Thay ainlie ken th’ bite o’ oor axes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horn-signals/horn-7.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4500,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
